---
// Left: a policy asked every step drifts from the demonstration, each step's
// small error moving it to a state the next answer has not seen. Right: chunks
// of H = 8 steps of which the first k = 2 run before the next is asked.
const cell = 22;
const rows = [0, 1, 2, 3];
---

<figure class="pk-fig not-content">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 720 250" role="img" aria-label="한 step 씩 낸 동작의 오차 누적과 chunk 실행의 비교">
		<text x="20" y="20" class="head">한 step 씩 추론</text>
		<path class="wire dash" d="M30 200 C 130 190, 230 170, 320 160" />
		<path class="wire hot-wire" d="M30 200 L66 195 L102 187 L138 175 L174 158 L210 135 L246 106 L282 72 L318 32" />
		<g class="dot">
			<circle cx="30" cy="200" r="3" /><circle cx="66" cy="195" r="3" /><circle cx="102" cy="187" r="3" />
			<circle cx="138" cy="175" r="3" /><circle cx="174" cy="158" r="3" /><circle cx="210" cy="135" r="3" />
			<circle cx="246" cy="106" r="3" /><circle cx="282" cy="72" r="3" /><circle cx="318" cy="32" r="3" />
		</g>
		<text x="232" y="192" class="dim">시연 궤적</text>
		<text x="160" y="110" class="hot">policy 궤적</text>
		<text x="20" y="222" class="dim">step 마다의 오차 ε 가 시연에 없던 state 로</text>
		<text x="20" y="238" class="dim">밀어내, T step 뒤에는 O(T²ε) 까지 벌어짐</text>

		<text x="380" y="20" class="head">chunk 를 내고 앞부분만 실행</text>
		{rows.map((r) => {
			const x0 = 380 + r * 2 * cell;
			const y = 40 + r * 34;
			return (
				<g>
					{Array.from({ length: 8 }, (_, i) => (
						<rect x={x0 + i * cell} y={y} width={cell - 2} height="18" rx="3" class={i < 2 ? 'box-hot' : 'box'} />
					))}
					<text x={x0 - 6} y={y + 13} class="dim" text-anchor="end">{r + 1}</text>
				</g>
			);
		})}
		<path class="wire" d="M380 196 L708 196" marker-end="url(#chunk-arrow)" />
		<path class="wire hot-wire" d="M380 186 L556 186" stroke-width="3" />
		<text x="380" y="222" class="dim">분홍 칸만 실행하고 다음 chunk 를 추론</text>
		<text x="380" y="238" class="dim">H = 8, k = 2 의 개념도 (ACT 는 50 fps 에서 100, 5)</text>
		<defs>
			<marker id="chunk-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10z" class="fill-dim" />
			</marker>
		</defs>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		한 step 씩 추론하면 결정마다 오차가 쌓이지만, chunk 를 내면 결정 횟수가 k 분의 1 로 줄고 chunk 안의 step 들은 한 번에 만들어져 매끄럽게 이어집니다.
	</figcaption>
</figure>
